{"id":"mohcd-caper-test","title":"Paired records against the office's reports to HUD","question":"For the same activity and year, does the report to HUD print the published record count or half of it?","finding":"The office's reports to HUD print half the published count for 13 of 13 paired activity-years tested, and the full count for 10 of 10 activity-years whose records are not paired.","how":"Records grouped by program area, activity and fiscal year; inside each, counted by race group x income band x age band x neighbourhood x client number. A group is \"paired\" when it has at least 5 such cells and at least 95% of them hold an even count. The CAPER test looks for half (paired) or all (controls) of the records among the whole numbers printed beside the matching output indicator in the 2017-18 and 2018-19 CAPER texts.","limits":"A figure found near the indicator label could in principle be another column of the same table; each match was also read by eye for the rows listed.","tier":"REDFLAG","columns":[{"k":"program","t":"Program area","type":"text"},{"k":"activity","t":"Activity","type":"text"},{"k":"fy","t":"Fiscal year","type":"text"},{"k":"records","t":"Records published","type":"int"},{"k":"paired","t":"Paired","type":"text"},{"k":"caperHalf","t":"Half in HUD report","type":"text"},{"k":"caperAll","t":"All in HUD report","type":"text"},{"k":"caper","t":"Report","type":"text"}],"rows":[{"program":"Eviction Prevention","activity":"Rental Assistance / Eviction Prevention","fy":"2015-16","records":1534,"paired":"yes","caperHalf":"printed","caperAll":"not printed","caper":"2017-18"},{"program":"Eviction Prevention","activity":"Rental Assistance / Eviction Prevention","fy":"2016-17","records":1086,"paired":"yes","caperHalf":"printed","caperAll":"not printed","caper":"2017-18"},{"program":"Eviction Prevention","activity":"Rental Assistance / Eviction Prevention","fy":"2017-18","records":924,"paired":"yes","caperHalf":"printed","caperAll":"not printed","caper":"20